    85	  `(60,1,1) = K_i**0.5` × zero-padded gamma `(60, 1, K_max)`; then
    86	  `baddbmm(b_pad (60,1,D), x_norm (60,T,K_max), W_pad (60,K_max,D))` with
    87	  `W_pad[i, :K_i, :] = W_iᵀ` and zero rows beyond K_i, `b_pad[i] = b_i`;
    88	  transpose back to `(1, T, 60, D)` = the stock `torch.stack(dim=-2)` order.
