   335	  **Plan 1.7 dependency model (registered):** the exports carry no event or
   336	  graph edges, so the critical-path view is the OBSERVED-ORDER longest chain
   337	  of pairwise non-overlapping kernels (edge a→b iff a ended before b
   338	  started); it is an upper bound on the true dependency path, satisfies
   339	  `critical_path ≤ union ≤ span` by construction (asserted), and is labelled
   340	  as such; the union and the summed views are exact.
