   342	  session 1 (the `sm120` smoke rule): its outputs are never session evidence
   343	  and are never cited.
   344	- Budget guard: every process runs under `timeout`; a timed-out or crashed
   345	  run is INVALID/UNTESTED in its JSON and the session continues (loud in the
