     8	              CorrIds = graphs visited), cudaLaunchKernel*/cuLaunchKernel*
     9	              (eager launches), memcpy/memset API calls
    10	  GPU rows  : a kernel is CAPTURED iff its CorrId belongs to a graph launch;
    11	              EAGER iff it belongs to a kernel-launch API call; UNRESOLVED
    12	              otherwise. Eager kernels are split into external input staging
    13	              (cudagraph-trees `_foreach_copy_`/multi_tensor_apply copies and
